  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Given initial velocity&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>u</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>9</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math>.</p><p>Acceleration&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>&#956;</mi><mi>g</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>9</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>9</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></math></p><p>Using,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>v</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>u</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>a</mi><mi>s</mi></math>, here, final velocity&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>v</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>.</p><p>So,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>0</mn><mo>=</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>9</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>8</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mfenced><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>9</mn></mrow></mfenced><mi>s</mi><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>s</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>9</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></math></p>",
